# The offline table on a 1280 x 720 window: the guest menu over the casino
# (How to play opened and closed), Play, a whole match shoving every turn
# (key A) until the result, New match, and back to the menu.
# viewport 1280x720
until 600 =Play
frames 30
click =How to play
until 60 Hand rankings, best to worst
frames 10
save menu-help
click =How to play
frames 10
click =Play
until 600 Pot
frames 90
save table-desktop
repeat 40000 until Winner:
  key KeyA 2
  frames 30
end
frames 30
save match-over
click =New match
frames 120
save new-match
frames 30
click Leave table
until 600 =Play
frames 10
